## TODO: drop-electron-compat

After all users have migrated from Electron to Tauri (confirm by checking analytics or
waiting until the Tauri build has been stable for several releases), remove the following:

### release.yml
- Remove the "Rename Linux artifacts for electron-updater compat" step
- Remove `linux-deb/pd3-mod-manager.deb` and `linux-rpm/pd3-mod-manager.rpm` from the publish files list
- Remove the "Generate latest.yml and latest-linux.yml (electron-updater compat)" step
- Remove `latest.yml` and `latest-linux.yml` from the publish files list
- Linux artifacts will then upload under Tauri's native names

### settings.rs + lib.rs
- Delete `migrate_from_electron` from `settings.rs`
- Remove its call site in `lib.rs`

